			"notes": "Changelog:\n\n- When bees collect pollen and nectar, they are marked to identify where they got it from.\n- When bees return to the hive or nest, their nectar data is copied to it.\n- When the player collects honey from a hive, they might receive different kinds of honey depending on its nectar data.\n- Added the Bonflower, a tier 2 flower. It produces light and can be used as fuel.\n- Added Bonflower Honey. It is made by bees from Bonflower nectar, and grants Night Vision when drunk."
